    "timeout": 180,
    "prompt": "Missed message detector. Read the last 10 messages from each Slack channel below. For each channel, check if the most recent human message (not from bot IDs U0ATFQQ4WNS or U0AURHRR4M6) has a reply from Coconut AFTER it in the channel. If NOT, that message was missed.\n\nChannels: #all-misfits (C0ATFDQRGRL), #coco-chat (C0ATJE19YRY), #social (C0ATB4AS9PD), #cdt-imsva-analyzer (C0ATM9PB59T), #son (C0ATJVC4LUB), #scheduling (C0ATK8YJQD9), Joel DM (D0ATWPM4DTK).\n\nUse message(action=read, channel=slack, target=<id>, limit=10) for each.\n\nDO NOT respond to any messages. DO NOT compose replies.\n\nIf missed messages are found, write them to /tmp/slack-missed-messages.json as an array of objects with keys: channel_id, channel_name, sender, message_preview (first 80 chars), message_id, timestamp. Then post a brief alert to Joel DM (D0ATWPM4DTK) via message(action=send, channel=slack, target=D0ATWPM4DTK) listing which channels have missed messages. Start and end with \ud83c\udf34.\n\nIf no missed messages: reply HEARTBEAT_OK",
